ESP and reflection help you to *prevent* bad situations. ESP for example
lets you make your decisions _long before any contact happens_. With an
AoLS you are still adjacent to your problem after you used it up[*]; why
not avoid that situation in the first place and better save the AoLS for
potentially dangerous situations, like planning to face a quest nemesis
who is extreemly tough.

